                            <comment id="17426058" author="zjffdu" created="Fri, 8 Oct 2021 09:21:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the feedback &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jyoo94&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jyoo94&quot;&gt;jyoo94&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Would you like to help fix it ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17426069" author="jyoo94" created="Fri, 8 Oct 2021 09:37:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Sure, am not that familiar with making contribution, so please help me &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am looking at &lt;a href=&quot;https://zeppelin.apache.org/contribution/contributions.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://zeppelin.apache.org/contribution/contributions.html&lt;/a&gt;&#160;document and will make a PR after I do step 3, 4.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17426111" author="zjffdu" created="Fri, 8 Oct 2021 10:59:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jyoo94&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;jyoo94&quot;&gt;jyoo94&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Regarding how to build jdbc interpreter, you can use the following command.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
mvn clean &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; -DskipTests -pl jdbc -am &lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;new jdbc interpreter jar will be generated under ZEPPELIN_HOME/interpreter/jdbc, then you can verify your change.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let me know if you need any further help.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
