 &lt;cite&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;ERROR&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Failed to execute goal on project zeppelin-jdbc: Could not resolve dependencies for project org.apache.zeppelin:zeppelin-jdbc:jar:0.10.1-SNAPSHOT: Could not find artifact jdk.tools:jdk.tools:jar:1.7 at specified path /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/zulu-11.jdk/Contents/Home/../lib/tools.jar -&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Help 1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
