                            <comment id="17427975" author="jyoo94" created="Wed, 13 Oct 2021 01:35:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt;&#160;Ah ok. I made a PR&#160;and thx for help &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

