                            <comment id="17442566" author="jyoo94" created="Fri, 12 Nov 2021 04:03:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zjffdu&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zjffdu&quot;&gt;zjffdu&lt;/a&gt; I know this question might be silly and out-of-date but I forgot how to replace new jdbc jar file.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I am trying to figure out some issue and&#160;my new jdbc created by command below&lt;br/&gt;
mvn clean package -DskipTests -pl jdbc -am&lt;br/&gt;
lacks some class files compared to jar file installed at &quot;ZEPPELIN_HOME/interpreter/jdbc&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13036002/13036002_image-2021-11-12-12-58-52-420.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

